      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Live video sharing and viewing are done through a video streaming server. The server is accessed using the credentials provided by the Deploy App.</p>\n<h2 id=\"deploy-app-credentials-and-streams\"><a href=\"#deploy-app-credentials-and-streams\">Deploy App credentials and streams</a></h2>\n<p><code>https://mtx.</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:4626/api/v1/direct/credentials</code></p>\n<p><code>https://mtx.</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:4626/api/v1/direct/streams</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"naming-convention\"><a href=\"#naming-convention\"><strong>Naming convention:</strong></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"stream-path-naming\"><a href=\"#stream-path-naming\">Stream path naming</a></h3>\n<p><em><code>live/tool/callsign</code></em></p>\n<h4 id=\"list-of-tools\"><a href=\"#list-of-tools\">List of tools</a></h4>\n<p><code>icu, gopro, uas, ipcam</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"streams-with-tools\"><a href=\"#streams-with-tools\">Streams with tools</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"publishing-streams\"><a href=\"#publishing-streams\">Publishing streams</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"opentak-icu\"><a href=\"#opentak-icu\">Opentak ICU</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/en/wikis/mtx/opentak-icu-6hPftpHVcX\">Opentak ICU</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"gopro-app\"><a href=\"#gopro-app\">GoPro App</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/gopro/</code><strong><code>Callsing</code></strong><code>?user=</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>&#x26;pass=</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"uastool\"><a href=\"#uastool\">Uastool</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=publish:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/en/wikis/mtx/uas-tool-streaming-nxo5zBYr3D\">Uastool Streaming</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"watching-streams\"><a href=\"#watching-streams\">Watching streams</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"vlc\"><a href=\"#vlc\">VLC</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=read:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>/index.m3u8</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"browser\"><a href=\"#browser\">Browser</a></h4>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>/</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"atak\"><a href=\"#atak\">ATAK</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>?user=</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>&#x26;pass=</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"sharing-the-link-via-takserver\"><a href=\"#sharing-the-link-via-takserver\"><strong>Sharing the link via</strong> Takserver</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>?user=</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>&#x26;pass=</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/images/en/attachments/106978dd70770c1e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"469\" height=\"366\">Takserver - Hamburger Menu → Data → Video Feed Manager → Add</p>\n<h2 id=\"streams-with-protocols\"><a href=\"#streams-with-protocols\">Streams with protocols</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"publishing-streams-1\"><a href=\"#publishing-streams-1\">Publishing streams</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"rtsps-publishing\"><a href=\"#rtsps-publishing\">RTSPS Publishing</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtsps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8322/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>rtsps://</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong><code>@</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8322/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"rtmps-publishing\"><a href=\"#rtmps-publishing\">RTMPS Publishing</a></h4>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>rtmps://</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong><code>@</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:1936/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"srt-publishing\"><a href=\"#srt-publishing\">SRT Publishing</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=publish:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>&#x26;pkt_size=1316</code></p>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=publish:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong><code>&#x26;pkt_size=1316</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"watching-streams-1\"><a href=\"#watching-streams-1\">Watching streams</a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"browser-using-hls-protocol\"><a href=\"#browser-using-hls-protocol\">Browser using HLS-protocol</a></h4>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong></p>\n<h4 id=\"vlc-player\"><a href=\"#vlc-player\">VLC Player</a></h4>\n<p><code>srt://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:8890?streamid=read:live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>USERNAME</code></strong><code>:</code><strong><code>PASSWORD</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>https://</code><strong><code>canadian-goose.pvarki.fi</code></strong><code>:9888/live/icu/</code><strong><code>Callsign</code></strong><code>/index.m3u8</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"you-can-share-the-links-with-qr-code\"><a href=\"#you-can-share-the-links-with-qr-code\">You can share the links with QR Code</a></h2>\n<p>Free QR code generator</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://new.express.adobe.com/tools/generate-qr-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.express.adobe.com/tools/generate-qr-code</a></p>"
    }
